# INDEX: UI

## Required

1. `project-rules/rules/ui_rules.md`
2. `project-rules/rules/operational_rules.md`

## On trigger

- `architecture_rules.md`: new component, new boundary, or structural decision.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: error states, retry, or failure feedback.
- `auth_rules.md`: restricted screen/route, session, or permission.
- `security_rules.md`: sensitive data or PII in display/input.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

## References

- `domain_examples.md`: non-trivial entity display or mapping.
- Omit this section when there is no actionable reference.
